{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have you ever dreamed of crafting beautiful floral arrangements that brighten someone's day?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flowers and Favours</strong> is a cozy and relaxing florist sim where you can craft beautiful bouquets, experiment with different blooms, and run your very own flower shop. This is your space to create and unwind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/dialor.gif?t=1749216534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Listen and Learn</strong> - Chat with adorable customers to understand their unique stories and needs for the perfect bouquet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/tools.gif?t=1749216534\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unleash Your Creativity</strong> - Create one-of-a-kind bouquets using intuitive and flexible design tools\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/wrapping_process.gif?t=1749216534\" /><strong>Complete Your Masterpiece With the Perfect Wrap</strong> - Select from elegant wrapping options, ribbons, and finishing touches to make each bouquet truly special</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upcoming Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Photo Mode </strong>- Capture your beautiful bouquets and keep them in a special memory book.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shop Customization </strong>- Decorate your flower shop and design a space that feels uniquely yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creative Workbench </strong>- Personalize your crafting area to match your floral style.<